# Mutation check of the demo API's acceptance rules and of the checker
# First run 09.11.2026 before commit 0fe2811 (the table in live/W2_DEMO_2026-11-09.md);
# re-run 09.11.2026 16:05 UTC on main (272db8f + the public-prep doc commit) with the same patches.
# Method: copy demo/ + script/evm_rpc.py (and script/checker.py, test_checker.py, deployments/latest.json)
# to a scratch dir, apply one patch with 'patch -p1', run the offline tests there. The repo itself is never edited.
# A mutant is killed when the test file exits non-zero.

